            ("eq", r"\lVert\mathbf{w}-\mathbf{x}\rVert^2 = \lVert\mathbf{w}\rVert^2 + \lVert\mathbf{x}\rVert^2 - 2\lVert\mathbf{w}\rVert\lVert\mathbf{x}\rVert\cos\theta"),
            ("p", r"Boshqa tomondan, uzunlik kvadratini koordinatalar bo‘yicha ochamiz:"),
            ("eq", r"\lVert\mathbf{w}-\mathbf{x}\rVert^2 = \sum_{i=1}^{n}(w_i - x_i)^2 = \sum w_i^2 + \sum x_i^2 - 2\sum w_ix_i = \lVert\mathbf{w}\rVert^2 + \lVert\mathbf{x}\rVert^2 - 2\,\mathbf{w}^{\top}\mathbf{x}"),
            ("p", r"O‘ng tomonlar teng, demak $\mathbf{w}^{\top}\mathbf{x} = \lVert\mathbf{w}\rVert\lVert\mathbf{x}\rVert\cos\theta$. Algebraik va geometrik formulalar — ayni bir narsa."),
